ht: 8.5313px; --x-8dd7yt: -0.0137em; --x-hxtmnb: 0.0137em;">9/14/2026</span></div></div><div class="x6s0dn4 xhslqc4 x78zum5 x1nxh6w3 x1fc57z9 xr9ek0c xisnujt" data-testid="cell-frame-secondary"><div class="xjbqb8w x1iyjqo2 x1f6kntn x1fc57z9 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1yc453h xlyipyv xuxw1ft xo1l8bm"><span class="x78zum5 x1cy8zhl" title="‪Good evening everyone,
We are sorry to announce the cancellation of the 2026 Belize Mobile Masters, Call of Duty Tournament

I know, it’s very unfortunate. Our team put so many hours into setting up and getting things ready, and we were getting hyped about what this year’s tournament had in store. 
But as the time got nearer for the tournament, there were a couple of concerns that came up and we also realized we had a lot of other projects stacking up, and eventually we decided the best thing to do was cancel the tournament.

We know it’s unfortunate– and a lot of you were also very excited  about the tournament. So we want to say thank you to all the teams that signed up.
 We can’t leave you guys empty handed. So we are giving away a Infinix GT 50 Pro Gaming phone to one of you who signed up for the tournament.

But yeah, once again, thank you so much to everyone who signed up for the tournament.‬" data-testid="last-msg-status"><div class="x1c4vz4f x3nfvp2 xuce83p x1bft6iq x1i7k8ik xq9mrsl x6s0dn4"><div class="x78zum5"><span dir="auto" class="x1rg5ohu xnpuxes" style="min-height: 0px;">~Belize Mobile Masters</span></div></div><span>:&nbsp;</span><div class="x1rg5ohu x1c4vz4f x2lah0s xdl72j9 xhslqc4 x16dsc37 x1qx5ct2 x1p8j9ns" data-testid="chat-msg-symbol"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" fill="currentColor"><title>ic-videocam</title><path fill="currentColor" d="M4 20c-.55 0-1.02-.2-1.41-.59-.4-.39-.59-.86-.59-1.41V6c0-.55.2-1.02.59-1.41C2.98 4.19 3.45 4 4 4h12c.55 0 1.02.2 1.41.59.4.39.59.86.59 1.41v4.5l3.15-3.15c.17-.17.35-.2.55-.13.2.09.3.25.3.48v8.6c0 .23-.1.4-.3.47-.2.09-.38.05-.55-.12L18 13.5V18c0 .55-.2 1.02-.59 1.41-.39.4-.86.59-1.41.59H4Zm0-2h12V6H4v12Z"></path></svg></span></div><span dir="ltr" class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1rg5ohu xnpuxes" style="min-height: 0px;">Good evening everyone,
We are sorry to announce the cancellation of the 2026 Belize Mobile Masters, Call of Duty Tournament

I know, it’s very unfortunate. Our team put so many hours into setting up and getting things ready, and we were getting hyped about what this year’s tournament had in store.&nbsp;
But as the time got nearer for the tournament, there were a couple of concerns that came up and we also realized we had a lot of other projects stacking up, and eventually we decided the best thing to do was cancel the tournament.

We know it’s unfortunate– and a lot of you were also very excited&nbsp;&nbsp;about the tournament. So we want to say thank you to all the teams that signed up.
&nbsp;We can’t leave you guys empty handed. So we are giving away a Infinix GT 50 Pro Gaming phone to one of you who signed up for the tournament.

